WEBVTT

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:34.403
Actually what we see in those cases
are these great concentric rings of houses

00:09:34.445 --> 00:09:37.573
arranged rather like
the inside of a tree trunk

00:09:37.615 --> 00:09:40.117
around neighborhood assembly halls.

00:09:40.534 --> 00:09:45.831
And it stayed that way
for about 800 years.

00:09:48.334 --> 00:09:54.548
So what this means is that long before
the birth of democracy in ancient Greece,

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:57.635
there were already well-organized cities

00:09:57.635 --> 00:09:59.970
on several of the world's continents

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:04.183
which present no evidence
for ruling dynasties.